+# inkling2-mini-i8r-rtn.recipe -- Inkling 2 Mini with its attention linears and lm_head int8 by round to
+# nearest, no calibration data read. The linears are rotated by fwht128 under a bf16 scale a
+# (row, 128) and served by inkling2loop at i8a8h behind had_quant_act_i8g; the head is unrotated.
+# The experts keep the release's NVFP4 and MXFP8, the sink, taps and message gates bf16.
+# The int8 GEMMs fold by row count, so greedy output with speculation can differ from without;
+# inkling2-mini-iqr5.recipe's does not.
+#
+#   rad-convert <Inkling-2-Mini> --recipe data/recipes/inkling2-mini-i8r-rtn.recipe --max-spec 0 \
+#       -o ink-i8r.rad
+#
+# One R9700, one stream: 51.4 tok/s against 45.6 for bf16 linears and head. KL against the bf16
+# container over 19,545 positions of held-out code chat: mean 0.0045, top-1 98.07%; layer 0's q
+# alone at int8 gives 0.0043, the floor the routing's near-ties set. At effort low, 8192 tokens:
+# 51/92 code and 29/40 reasoning problems against bf16's 55/92 and 28/40.
+
+blk.*.attn_q.weight              rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
+blk.*.attn_k.weight              rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
+blk.*.attn_v.weight              rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
+blk.*.attn_rel.weight            rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
+blk.*.attn_output_gate.weight    rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
+blk.*.attn_output.weight         rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 transform=fwht128 clamp=sym rule=search
+output.weight                    rtn   codes=i8 group=128 scale=bf16 clamp=sym rule=search
