+ * ar_causal_conv1d from x (operands 4 on). On the LL path the GEMM's 16-token tile pushes x's words
+ * into the peer's slots itself, so the all-reduce only waits for the peer's and sums; the GEMM
+ * reads the parity counter the all-reduce will advance, so nothing else may launch on the instance
+ * between the two. Both ranks take the same path, decided from shapes alone. */
+extern "C" int r4d_rad_gemm_ar_causal_conv1d(const RadArgs* a, RadStream s) {
+    const ArInst* in = (const ArInst*)(a ? a->instance : nullptr);
+    if (!in || a->n_t < 13) return RAD_E_STATE;
